267
00:20:30,820 --> 00:20:34,640
You're a funny one.

268
00:20:34,760 --> 00:20:38,657
Well, I don't personally object, but our
captain is the one who has the final word.

269
00:20:38,740 --> 00:20:40,197
You'll have to run it by him first.

270
00:20:40,280 --> 00:20:41,300
Yeah, of course.

271
00:20:49,560 --> 00:20:51,700
I hope he's okay after all that.

272
00:20:57,840 --> 00:21:00,680
The way he fought gave
me chills. It was great.

273
00:21:01,440 --> 00:21:02,780
He was so free.

274
00:21:03,920 --> 00:21:07,040
Just whoosh, bang, boom
all over the place.

275
00:21:07,300 --> 00:21:08,440
It was incredible.

276
00:21:12,780 --> 00:21:14,477
Hey let's get out of here.

277
00:21:14,560 --> 00:21:16,257
Yeah we gotta go now.

278
00:21:16,340 --> 00:21:17,757
We showed them no mercy.

279
00:21:17,840 --> 00:21:19,917
They'll definitely do the same to us.

280
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:23,737
We're

281
00:21:23,820 --> 00:21:28,457
not done.

282
00:21:28,540 --> 00:21:30,837
I didn't say you could go.

283
00:21:30,920 --> 00:21:32,957
I don't want to be slaves.

284
00:21:33,040 --> 00:21:35,417
Young master don't move
or I'll pound your face.

285
00:21:35,500 --> 00:21:38,697
Then don't you know it's
unbecoming of a soldier to flee?

286
00:21:38,780 --> 00:21:41,620
You'll take this like a man! You hear me?

287
00:21:43,980 --> 00:21:46,039
Seems like they're not our enemies.

288
00:21:46,620 --> 00:21:49,697
Yeah, speaking of which, what's
going to happen to the two of them?

289
00:21:49,780 --> 00:21:50,880
I forgot to say!

290
00:21:51,140 --> 00:21:53,757
My power will wear off
when the same moon rises.

291
00:21:53,840 --> 00:21:55,537
So, it'll take a whole month?

292
00:21:55,620 --> 00:21:56,855
Yep, that's the deal.

293
00:21:56,980 --> 00:21:58,997
Sometimes when the animals
turn back to normal,

294
00:21:59,080 --> 00:22:01,997
they decide they don't
want to be friends anymore.

295
00:22:02,080 --> 00:22:05,021
But others decide to hang
around and stay buddies.

296
00:22:05,680 --> 00:22:06,510
Interesting.

297
00:22:06,620 --> 00:22:08,697
Maybe it depends on their personality.

298
00:22:08,780 --> 00:22:12,545
I guess, in the end, they just
choose whatever makes them happy.

299
00:22:12,860 --> 00:22:13,880
Hee hee!

300
00:22:15,080 --> 00:22:16,380
Come here, master.

301
00:22:17,300 --> 00:22:18,360
Don't you worry.

302
00:22:18,540 --> 00:22:21,128
I'll be happy if we can
stay just like this.

303
00:22:23,020 --> 00:22:26,020
Marcelino, I'd be happy if
you stayed with me, too.

304
00:22:28,260 --> 00:22:30,140
But not as a servant.

305
00:22:31,000 --> 00:22:32,560
Maybe more like a mom.

306
00:22:32,860 --> 00:22:35,036
That way, we can be together forever.

307
00:22:39,140 --> 00:22:40,340
Are you okay?

308
00:22:48,260 --> 00:22:49,497
Thank you, Master.

309
00:22:49,580 --> 00:22:50,957
Thank you so much.

310
00:22:51,040 --> 00:22:54,520
No matter what happens,
you've truly brought me joy.

311
00:22:55,400 --> 00:22:58,920
I'm glad, but can you hold me
a little less tight, please?

312
00:23:02,100 --> 00:23:03,520
I'm so happy for them.

313
00:23:03,800 --> 00:23:05,040
I'm choking up.

314
00:23:18,640 --> 00:23:20,100
Hey, guys, look.

315
00:23:20,280 --> 00:23:21,417
They're kneeling down.

316
00:23:21,500 --> 00:23:23,912
I think someone else is about to show up.

317
00:23:33,100 --> 00:23:35,000
Hold on. Who's that?

318
00:23:43,980 --> 00:23:48,840
It's been 20 years since my
father, Kozuki Oden, died.

319
00:23:50,840 --> 00:23:51,670
Father?

320
00:23:51,753 --> 00:23:52,840
It can't be.

321
00:23:53,880 --> 00:23:58,740
You have endured many hardships,
but those days have come to an end.

322
00:23:58,920 --> 00:24:00,802
The fire festival will continue.

323
00:24:01,120 --> 00:24:03,440
You may carry on however you please.

324
00:24:03,940 --> 00:24:05,840
But what did she say?

325
00:24:06,220 --> 00:24:09,280
You may drink as much as
you like. Wait, really?

326
00:24:09,700 --> 00:24:11,800
Well water will be free of charge.

327
00:24:13,000 --> 00:24:16,280
The factories will not be
allowed to poison the land.

328
00:24:16,980 --> 00:24:18,921
And no one shall live as a slave.

329
00:24:21,420 --> 00:24:23,320
Is that Momo?

330
00:24:23,780 --> 00:24:26,580
Your suffering is over.

331
00:24:37,660 --> 00:24:40,020
Four more died at the factory today.

332
00:24:40,440 --> 00:24:41,920
Might be me tomorrow.

333
00:24:57,780 --> 00:24:59,480
Someone has to tell Otama.

334
00:25:04,200 --> 00:25:06,040
Otama, I'm so sorry.

335
00:25:06,620 --> 00:25:09,540
Your mother and father aren't coming back.

336
00:25:23,840 --> 00:25:27,420
Mom, Dad, you can rest in peace, okay?

337
00:25:27,760 --> 00:25:29,936
I'm going to be just fine, I promise.

338
00:25:33,400 --> 00:25:35,440
Don't deal, you're tickling me.

339
00:25:38,560 --> 00:25:40,340
Woven hats for sale!

340
00:25:40,820 --> 00:25:42,940
Does anybody need a hat?

341
00:25:43,620 --> 00:25:45,020
Quality guaranteed!

342
00:25:45,720 --> 00:25:47,460
You won't find a better deal!

343
00:25:47,880 --> 00:25:49,560
Do you need a new hat, sir?

344
00:25:49,740 --> 00:25:51,180
I don't have any money.

345
00:25:53,360 --> 00:25:55,440
Find woven hats for sale!

346
00:25:55,840 --> 00:25:58,080
They'll protect you from the snow!

347
00:26:06,500 --> 00:26:12,360
I'm sorry, I couldn't sew any hats, but
it's okay, I'll just try again tomorrow.

348
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:32,120
May I have a hat, please?

349
00:26:36,920 --> 00:26:38,280
A tingle!

350
00:26:43,400 --> 00:26:44,780
Are you an orphan?

351
00:26:45,960 --> 00:26:47,800
You must stay strong.

352
00:26:51,060 --> 00:26:52,920
Just a few years more,

353
00:26:53,080 --> 00:26:56,786
the samurai of the Kozuki clan
will return to the land of Wano.

354
00:26:57,060 --> 00:27:01,472
And the demons who took control of this
country will be brought to justice.

355
00:27:02,680 --> 00:27:03,700
A tingle!

356
00:27:04,260 --> 00:27:05,090
Hmm.

357
00:27:11,460 --> 00:27:13,380
I'll work hard till then!

358
00:27:18,820 --> 00:27:22,260
I'll be strong like the
samurai from the Kozuki clan!

359
00:27:22,500 --> 00:27:24,740
All I gotta do is keep believing!

360
00:27:25,180 --> 00:27:26,380
I'll be okay!

361
00:27:31,660 --> 00:27:32,490
Tama?

362
00:27:32,840 --> 00:27:34,280
What's wrong, Master?

363
00:27:41,080 --> 00:27:43,640
Tama, I'm gonna make this a normal thing.

364
00:27:43,880 --> 00:27:46,260
I swear that by the time we leave Wano,

365
00:27:46,500 --> 00:27:50,324
it'll be a place where you can
eat as much as you want every day.

366
00:28:03,020 --> 00:28:06,160
You need not fear Orochi or Kaido.

367
00:28:06,560 --> 00:28:08,700
Their reign of terror is finished!

368
00:28:17,720 --> 00:28:20,937
I traveled the seas and
made powerful new friends.

369
00:28:21,020 --> 00:28:24,237
With the ninja pirate
mink samurai alliance.

370
00:28:24,320 --> 00:28:25,917
We raided Onigashima.

371
00:28:26,000 --> 00:28:29,557
Orochi, Kaido, and the beast pirates.

372
00:28:29,640 --> 00:28:32,780
We faced all the evils that
threatened this country.

373
00:28:34,140 --> 00:28:37,320
And in the end, we emerged victorious.

374
00:28:41,100 --> 00:28:44,240
You mean you took on those
monsters and actually won?

375
00:28:44,560 --> 00:28:47,148
We won't have to battle
on our team anymore?

376
00:28:47,860 --> 00:28:49,720
We're not in a damned alliance.

377
00:28:54,820 --> 00:28:57,938
Does this mean we're going
to be happy every day now?

378
00:28:58,960 --> 00:29:00,640
Hooray! We got her!

379
00:29:00,900 --> 00:29:03,997
I never imagined you could
escape from this nightmare.

380
00:29:04,080 --> 00:29:04,910
Thank you!

381
00:29:05,360 --> 00:29:06,280
Thank you!

382
00:29:10,640 --> 00:29:16,160
Our fallen allies who helped us save
this land will never be forgotten.

383
00:29:45,960 --> 00:29:47,417
Kin'emon, what should I do?

384
00:29:47,500 --> 00:29:49,917
What else should I say to my people?

385
00:29:50,000 --> 00:29:54,640
I think this is your time to show off.

386
00:29:59,960 --> 00:30:03,431
Is there anything left in the
world that can scare you now?

387
00:30:07,420 --> 00:30:12,277
The name that my father gave
me means peerless among men.

388
00:30:12,360 --> 00:30:18,277
Under my rule, this broken land
shall become a paradise on earth.

389
00:30:18,360 --> 00:30:22,417
Lend me your strength and let us
work toward this end together.

390
00:30:22,500 --> 00:30:27,837
For I have traveled 20 years
through time to save this country.

391
00:30:27,920 --> 00:30:30,580
From this day forth.

392
00:30:33,580 --> 00:30:37,980
I, Kozuki Momonosuke, will
lead the land of Wano!

393
00:31:20,060 --> 00:31:22,860
Mother, I will keep my promise to you.

394
00:31:27,320 --> 00:31:30,360
Father, I will follow in your footsteps.

395
00:31:57,360 --> 00:31:59,277
The Closity clan is back!

396
00:31:59,360 --> 00:32:01,180
We have a real Shogun!

397
00:32:01,420 --> 00:32:05,360
We've been waiting for you
for so long! Thank you!

398
00:32:05,680 --> 00:32:06,798
I called my escape!

399
00:32:11,020 --> 00:32:12,960
A new dawn breaks.

400
00:32:13,180 --> 00:32:17,820
The warriors sheath their swords, and
flower petals flutter in the wind.

401
00:32:18,380 --> 00:32:23,980
The land has summarized new leader, a
handsome young man of eight years old,

402
00:32:24,340 --> 00:32:25,740
gazes to the sky.

403
00:32:26,340 --> 00:32:32,620
He is not a man of great strength, But
he is loyal and kind like no one else.

404
00:32:39,240 --> 00:32:43,940
Kozuki Momonosuke steps forth as
the Land of Wano's proud shogun.

405
00:32:44,280 --> 00:32:48,800
With his samurai at his side, he
will forge his place in history.
